305
00:50:48,900 --> 00:50:50,980
重ねど劣らずと踏み歩む
Stepping forward no matter how many times

306
00:50:51,280 --> 00:50:53,780
天の裁きは流されたんでしょ
Heaven's judgment was washed away, wasn't it?

307
00:50:53,980 --> 00:50:57,460
裁おう裁おうももっともっとね
Judging and judging even more and more

308
