ごめんね、大丈夫、安全圏に酔うね？安心な世界にこれ見せてないから、ずっと今日も
Sorry, it's alright, you're intoxicated in the safety zone, right? Since I'm not showing you this safe world, today too...

328
00:53:21,790 --> 00:53:23,790
