329
00:53:22,480 --> 00:53:25,020
引き裂きを据え音を立てるな
Don't make a sound bearing the tearing

330
00:53:25,020 --> 00:53:28,320
奴らに気付けられる前に
Before being noticed by those guys

331
00:53:28,540 --> 00:53:31,800
そのときはまたすべてが一瞬のために
At that time, everything is for a single moment

332
00:53:36,820 --> 00:53:43,080
カリスマのなくアイドルも顔も全部ブチ抜け Last-resort
Knock out all the charisma-less idols and faces, Last-resort

333
00:53:43,080 --> 00:53:46,820
逃げ場も探す下世話の世界で死にもの狂い
Madly struggling to death in a vulgar world looking for a place to run

334
00:53:46,820 --> 00:53:50,820
死ねないなら狂い続けたらいい
If you can't die, you might as well keep going crazy

335
00:53:52,840 --> 00:54:00,820
切な泣くなすべてをこの一瞬に賭けて放て Last-resort
Setsuna, don't cry, bet everything on this single moment and release it, Last-resort

336
00:54:14,480 --> 00:54:19,380
僕のすべてを込めて放て Last-resort
Releasing with my everything included, Last-resort

337
00:54:32,790 --> 00:54:34,790
[Title: 片羽]

338
00:54:34,280 --> 00:54:38,420
あなたがくれた希望で
With the hope you gave me

339
00:54:39,120 --> 00:54:44,320
約束の羽で今共に行こう
Let's go together now on the promised wings

340
00:54:49,240 --> 00:54:54,060
支配の先へ壊れるまで遠く遠く
Far and far beyond control until it breaks

341
00:54:56,220 --> 00:55:00,920
今の僕は片翼でいい飛べるよ
Right now, one wing is enough for me, I can fly

342
00:55:49,990 --> 00:55:54,050
世界で一番のアイドル
The number one idol in the world

343
00:56:00,860 --> 00:56:06,140
思い出して出会った日のこと 手を取って僕らの旅が始まった
Remembering the day we met, holding hands as our journey began

344
00:56:10,560 --> 00:56:15,630
走って転んで涙を流しても 気づけばほら顔合わせて笑う
Even if we run, fall, and shed tears, before we know it, we're laughing face to face

345
00:56:20,870 --> 00:56:26,410
喜ぶ声が嬉しくて夢があふれ出す 君がいなきゃだめなんだ
Your joyful voices make me so happy, dreams overflowing—I need you here

346
00:56:31,150 --> 00:56:36,320
今 世界で一番幸せなアイドルから 世界で一番の笑顔を上げちゃう
Now, from the happiest idol in the world, I'll give you the biggest smile in the world!

347
00:56:43,080 --> 00:56:48,320
僕を見つけてくれた愛してくれた だからまだまだ終わらない
You found me, you loved me, so it's not over yet

348
00:56:51,810 --> 00:56:56,300
ちゃんとついてきてきらめく夢へ
Follow me closely toward our sparkling dreams...

349
00:57:04,470 --> 00:57:09,510
羽ばたいていく背中を見送った 雨上がり君の傘を返したら
Watching your back as you flew away, after the rain when I returned your umbrella

350
00:57:15,260 --> 00:57:20,320
手を引いて進もう一緒にどこまでも 気づけばほらまた前を向く
Holding hands, let's go anywhere together; before we know it, we're looking forward again

351
00:57:25,060 --> 00:57:31,270
じゃれ合う言葉の中にも愛を感じていま 僕じゃなきゃだめなんだ、でしょ？
Feeling love even in our teasing words, I'm the only one for you, right?

352
00:57:37,440 --> 00:57:42,500
今 世界で一番幸せなアイドルから 世界で一番のときめきを上げちゃう
Now, from the happiest idol in the world, I'll give you the biggest thrill in the world!

353
00:57:48,860 --> 00:57:54,200
僕を支えてくれた押してくれた だからまだまだ終わらない
You supported me, you pushed me forward, so it's not over yet

354
00:57:56,750 --> 00:58:01,600
泊まりに行ってよ
Let's go stay over...

355
00:58:13,760 --> 00:58:18,360
もうやめよって泣いた日もあった
There were days I cried and wanted to quit...

356
00:58:19,040 --> 00:58:23,400
そんな時浮かんでくるみんなの声が
At times like those, everyone's voices would come to mind

357
00:58:25,010 --> 00:58:30,810
今までで一番あきらめたくないの ずっとりたかった 最強のアイドル
More than ever, I don't want to give up on this—the ultimate idol I always wanted to be

358
00:58:40,130 --> 00:58:45,180
今 世界で一番幸せなアイドルから 世界で一番の大好きを上げちゃう
Now, from the happiest idol in the world, I'll give you all my love!

359
00:58:51,260 --> 00:58:56,750
冴えない日常ももっと大きくて 芸能もまだまだ終われない
Even a dull routine becomes grander, and my idol journey isn't over yet

360
00:59:00,810 --> 00:59:05,120
君と結んでく
Weaving it together with you

361
00:59:32,920 --> 00:59:36,710
特者生存ワンダラダー!!
Tokusha Seizon Wonderadarr!!

362
00:59:42,410 --> 00:59:47,760
なびく石をおやばしつっこみおさえてほんでかいせっさわ
Flapping stones, dodging, holding back, and then talking it out!

363
00:59:50,940 --> 00:59:54,170
必死にがんばろう！ それが僕らしさだ！
Let's do our absolute best! That's what makes me, me!

364
01:00:00,634 --> 01:00:04,274
どうせ死ぬんだわ 飛んで貧乏くじなんだわ
We're gonna die anyway, pulling the short straw anyway...

365
01:00:04,694 --> 01:00:08,234
運搬じゃばっちり生き延びてルンに決まってる
We're definitely gonna survive smoothly and triumph!

366
01:00:08,894 --> 01:00:11,074
かなたちゃん ちゃんと生存しよう
Kanata-chan, let's survive properly!

367
01:00:11,554 --> 01:00:13,954
新長所とちゃんと歓迎して
Welcome our new strengths properly...

368
01:00:14,694 --> 01:00:17,214
高まる会議 理想像ちゃんと強打して
High-rising meetings, passionately striking our ideal images!

369
01:00:17,974 --> 01:00:20,314
興奮しよう 僕が呼んだもん
Let's get excited, since I called for it!

370
01:00:20,494 --> 01:00:23,554
本当にするんだもん 現実超えろ未来
We'll really make it happen, surpass reality, future!

371
01:00:28,494 --> 01:00:31,254
ざく点防御 壁水晶でラッチャ
Scraping defense, with crystal walls, latching on!

372
01:00:31,774 --> 01:00:35,634
すんまーじ読者生存 生存ワンダラダーって
Seriously reader survival, survival wonderadarr...

373
01:00:36,234 --> 01:00:41,614
でもしもおもしろがれること探し構えおだ
But let's search for things to enjoy and get ready!

374
01:00:42,094 --> 01:00:45,694
返し聞かせてくれ 右左どっこじゃない
Let me hear your response, it's not about left or right!

375
01:00:48,654 --> 01:00:52,594
傷つけ続け 一直線 つまりたくらんだら反射ライダ
Hurting and continuing in a straight line, meaning if you plot it, it's reflection rider!

376
01:00:54,994 --> 01:00:56,954
わくわく寸前さ
Right on the verge of excitement!

377
01:01:04,354 --> 01:01:09,434
ねえ みんなと離れるのが寂しいのと 楽器の健康は立ち直ってません
Hey, being apart from everyone is lonely, and my throat's health hasn't recovered...

378
01:01:10,054 --> 01:01:13,574
僕をアイドルにしてくれて みんな本当にありがとう
Thank you all so much for making me an idol!

379
01:01:14,054 --> 01:01:17,934
なんだよ そんなこと 一丁だめだ おばか
What is that, such a thing, that's no good, you dummy!

380
01:01:18,214 --> 01:01:22,194
わあすごい ありがとう ちょきぴーかるそーでんでごまべい
Wow amazing, thanks, cho-pi-karusoden de gomabei!

381
01:01:22,414 --> 01:01:25,454
こうしたんでいたいんだもん だって生きごごごごいいんだもんぜ
That's how I want to be, because living feels so good!

382
01:01:25,714 --> 01:01:29,914
法医ねがっさりおてのはていらっしゃい
Law doctor, sweep it up, come on out!

383
01:01:30,734 --> 01:01:34,534
いつでも心はちゃんと純粋で
Anytime my heart is purely sincere...

384
01:01:34,934 --> 01:01:41,174
一途いなこっぴし まぁだいぶね死んで 一途になって 行き切っせるんだ
Devotedly, persistently, well pretty much dying, becoming devoted and pushing through!

385
01:01:41,434 --> 01:01:44,787
調子に乗ったら すぐあきらめちゃうから
If I get carried away, I'll give up right away, so...

386
01:01:45,047 --> 01:01:48,407
あぁ 書き溜んだロボ とっても遠いですよ
Ah, written-up robots are super far away!

387
01:01:48,647 --> 01:01:52,647
すんまじとくしゃせいぞう わんだらんだって
Seriously, reader survival, wonderadarr...

388
01:01:52,887 --> 01:01:58,727
しみこみすけ 努力とは最後まであきらめないこと
Soaking it in, effort means never giving up until the very end!

389
01:01:59,047 --> 01:02:03,527
目守っておいて 本当はベイビ 自信がないよ
Keep watch over me, honestly baby, I have no confidence...

390
01:02:03,807 --> 01:02:07,787
本当はベイビ ふわもこで泣きそうだって
Honestly baby, being fluffy and soft makes me want to cry...

391
01:02:08,067 --> 01:02:13,387
骨ねベイビ くじけないって決めたの だからベイビ
Bone baby, I decided not to break, so baby!

392
01:02:13,627 --> 01:02:18,067
挑戦したいよ 世界の天地無限のビートで
I want to challenge the world with infinite beats!

393
01:02:18,307 --> 01:02:19,807
きて！
Come on!

394
01:02:36,954 --> 01:02:40,314
全身情緒とちゃんと歓迎して
Welcoming all emotional states properly...

395
01:02:40,734 --> 01:02:44,654
高まる会図 理想像ちゃんと強打して
High-rising diagrams, passionately striking ideal images!

396
01:02:45,074 --> 01:02:49,034
興奮しよう 僕が呼んだもん 本当にするんだもん
Let's get excited, since I called for it, we'll really make it happen!

397
01:02:49,354 --> 01:02:53,107
現実超えろ未来 あぁ ざく点防御 壁水晶でラッチャ
Surpass reality, future! Ah, scraping defense, with crystal walls, latching on!

398
01:02:53,367 --> 01:02:57,487
すんまじとくしゃせいぞう わんだらんだって
Seriously, reader survival, wonderadarr...

399
01:02:57,747 --> 01:03:01,687
楽しもう おもしろがれること探し放題でっせ
Let's enjoy ourselves, with endless things to find amusing!

400
01:03:02,007 --> 01:03:05,227
無限のフィールドで
In an infinite field...

401
01:03:05,447 --> 01:03:08,847
パンニングしなくたっていい ど真ん中一直線
You don't even have to pan, straight down the center!

402
01:03:09,107 --> 01:03:13,067
つまりこれが僕のことなんだ 胸を張れ
Meaning this is who I am, puff out your chest!

403
01:03:13,327 --> 01:03:17,207
今を生きるその意味を 明るい日も暗い日も確かめて進め
Cherish the meaning of living right now, check the bright and dark days and push forward!

404
01:03:17,467 --> 01:03:19,227
わんだら！
Wonderarr!

405
01:03:48,560 --> 01:03:56,020
みんな！ありがとうございますた！
Everyone! Thank you so much!

406
01:03:58,600 --> 01:04:05,460
え、聴いていただいたのはオリジナル楽曲「メドレー」メドレーにしました！繋ぎましたよ！
Um, what you just listened to was an original song medley! I connected them together!

407
01:04:05,840 --> 01:04:09,420
そして世界で1番のアイドル作詞をしました
And I wrote the lyrics for the number one idol in the world.

408
01:04:09,420 --> 01:04:14,660
この時卒業なんて考えてなかったから本当に、あのいっぱい聴いてほしい曲です。
At that time, I wasn't thinking about graduation at all, so it's a song I really want you to listen to a lot.

409
01:04:14,860 --> 01:04:18,480
そして「特者生存ワンダラダー!!」でした！はい！これを初めてね、出しましたね。
And that was "Tokusha Seizon Wonderadarr!!" Yes! This is the first time I performed it live.

410
01:04:18,680 --> 01:04:25,880
え、オリジナル楽曲ですけれどもちょっと語りたいこといっぱいあるんですけど
Uh, it's an original song, but there's a lot I want to talk about, but...

411
01:04:26,720 --> 01:04:30,160
やっぱりあの服だよね？ってことでね
As expected, that outfit, right? So...

412
01:04:30,300 --> 01:04:32,500
1秒着替えしてきましーーた！
I did a 1-second costume change!

413
01:04:33,560 --> 01:04:37,700
はい！やっぱこれだよねみんな！へいこんかなた！
Yes! This is definitely the one, everyone! Hey, Konkanata!

414
01:04:38,120 --> 01:04:46,720
キャッチコピーは握力50kg牛丼握り潰しちゃんさ、ホロライブ4期生天音かなたこたんばねかなたです。はい！
My catchphrase is "grip strength 50kg, beef bowl crushing chan," Hololive 4th generation Amane Kanata... wait, Amane Kanata! Yes!

415
01:04:47,200 --> 01:05:01,700
ということでね、6番…危ないことはね、危ない話はしないで置きまして、あのようね、あの感じで行きたいと思うんですけども、もう本当にオリジナル楽曲はね、フェスやイベント、ソロライブなど、もーほかにもたくさんの思い出が詰まっていて
And so, uh, number... let's not talk about dangerous things, and I want to go with that kind of feeling, but really, the original songs are packed with so many memories from festivals, events, solo lives, and so much more...

416
01:05:02,314 --> 01:05:07,374
みんながね、たくさん聞いてくれたおかげと言いますか、本当に出ありがとうございました、と思っています。
I truly believe that it's thanks to everyone listening to me so much... Thank you so much.

417
01:05:09,354 --> 01:05:27,274
ええ、みんなね、あの…この後ですね、あの22時10分から最後の歌ってみたみんなと約束してました、あの動画消えちゃって歌い直そうって言っていたね、あの「キング」を投稿するので絶対見てくださいね！
Um, everyone, um... After this, at 22:10, I promised everyone I'd re-record and post my cover of "King" since the old video disappeared, so please be sure to watch it!

418
01:05:29,334 --> 01:05:38,654
毎日一緒にいてくれたへい民、ホロライブの大好きなメンバーたち、そしてたくさん支えてくださった本当にお世話になった方々全ての方に感謝しています。
I am grateful to all the Heimin who stayed with me every day, my beloved Hololive members, and everyone who supported and cared for me so much.

419
01:05:39,274 --> 01:05:54,774
夢のような時間は本当にありがとうございました。心、ここに来る前に、子供の頃のアイドルになりたいって夢が、作詞作曲をしてみたいって夢を叶えました。そして、最後の曲ですが、まだ歌うんです！
Thank you so much for this dreamlike time. My childhood dream of becoming an idol and my dream of writing and composing songs came true here. And as for the final song... I'm still going to sing!

420
01:05:55,534 --> 01:06:12,734
僕が初めて作詞作曲した楽曲があります。今はいない同期、ここの卒業に合わせて4期生の、とはルータのために捧げた楽曲です。前を向いて笑顔でこの楽曲で活動を最後にしたいと思います。それでは聞いてください、「キセキ結び」！
There is a song that I wrote and composed for the very first time. It's a song dedicated to our missing generation-mate, and for Luna, tailored around her graduation. I want to conclude my activities with a smile, looking forward, with this song. So please listen... "Kiseki Musubi"!

421
01:06:22,332 --> 01:06:26,032
[Title: キセキ結び 作詞・作曲:天音かなた 編曲:ハム]
[Title: Kiseki Musubi Lyrics & Composition: Amane Kanata Arrangement: Ham]

422
01:06:26,452 --> 01:06:37,152
約束しようよ 僕ら出会えた奇跡 忘れないように
Let's make a promise so we'll never forget the miracle of how we met.

423
01:06:47,052 --> 01:06:56,552
夢抱いて集う 青春アニメみたいな ハッピーエンドになる あなたへ飛ぶよ
Gathering with dreams, like a youth anime... flying toward you for a happy ending!

424
01:06:57,552 --> 01:07:06,552
ねえ ボケて眠気あくびして 今日は何をしようか 永遠に続く海を駆け抜ける
Hey, joking, dozing off and yawning, what shall we do today? Racing across an endless sea.

425
01:07:07,152 --> 01:07:17,152
今は溜息より勇気を 諦めるなんてないの ここで歌う 僕の声は聴こえてますか
Now, courage rather than sighs—there's no giving up! Can you hear my voice singing here?

426
01:07:19,052 --> 01:07:29,752
君に届け学校の友達じゃ きっとない出会いだった
Reaching out to you—it was an encounter I'd surely never find with school friends.

427
01:07:30,252 --> 01:07:40,052
何年も先の遥か遠くまで ささくれた言葉も 誰かの笑顔になる
Far off into the years ahead, even prickly words will turn into someone's smile.

428
01:07:40,452 --> 01:07:51,452
それぞれの色で 星結ぶ奇跡 キラキラ輝くステージに 連れてくよ
With our respective colors, the miracle of connecting stars will lead you to a sparkling stage!

429
01:08:00,052 --> 01:08:09,652
泣いて 笑って はしゃいで 毎日チャットコースター たまには寝転んでお昼寝しよう
Crying, laughing, having fun—a daily chat coaster! Sometimes let's lie down and take a nap.

430
01:08:10,052 --> 01:08:19,852
ちょっと自信ない時 ことに取ってウェットして 今日だけは泣いちゃうこと許してね
When you're feeling a bit unconfident... forgive me for crying just for today.

431
01:08:20,252 --> 01:08:31,152
未来の僕がアルバム開く 傷ついた写真だって たたのものだ 僕の愛が見えてますか
The future me opens the album—even wounded photos are treasures. Can you see my love?

432
01:08:36,052 --> 01:08:47,552
君に届け過去も個性も 正解も違うけれど 弱気なときは殴った ぎゅっとつむり
Reaching out to you—our pasts, individualities, and correct answers differ, but when you felt weak...

433
01:08:48,252 --> 01:09:02,052
もう1回 もう1回 絶対に諦めない 前の背中追う 下手っぴな僕でも 君の隣にいたくて 走るよ
One more time, one more time, I'll never give up! Chasing the back ahead, even as clumsy as I am, I want to be by your side and run.

434
01:09:04,252 --> 01:09:25,252
誰にも言えずに 描いた夢が叶わなくても ボロボロの靴でも かっこよくなくても ああ 幼い あの日の僕ならなんて言う 止まらないで
Even if the dream I drew without telling anyone doesn't come true, even with tattered shoes, even if I'm not cool... Ah, what would my young self from back then say? Don't stop!

435
01:09:26,252 --> 01:09:41,052
初めて僕ら出会った日 まるで昨日みたいに思い出すけど もう行こうか 最後に今 重なる
The day we first met—I remember it as if it were yesterday, but let's go now, finally overlapping right now.

436
01:09:46,452 --> 01:09:59,052
僕の声は聴こえてますか 君に届け黒板のメッセージ さくらのカーテンくぐって 僕らの声を聴いて ずっとずっと
Can you hear my voice? Reaching out to you, a message on the chalkboard, passing through a curtain of cherry blossoms—listen to our voices, forever and ever.

437
01:10:04,300 --> 01:10:06,270
嬉しい日 楽しい日
A happy day, a joyful day,

438
01:10:06,490 --> 01:10:08,960
悲しい別れの日を
A sad day of parting,

439
01:10:09,410 --> 01:10:11,710
それぞれの色で
In our respective colors,

440
01:10:11,860 --> 01:10:14,730
星結ぶ奇跡
A miracle tying the stars together.

441
01:10:14,860 --> 01:10:18,490
キラキラ輝くステージで
On this sparkling, shining stage,

442
01:10:18,760 --> 01:10:23,450
約束をしよう
Let's make a promise...

443
01:10:23,450 --> 01:10:28,450
いつかどこかで また会おう
That we'll meet again somewhere, someday.

444
01:10:31,385 --> 01:10:36,385
笑える！ありがとう！ボロボロ泣いちゃうアイドルのかなたでした！
Laughing! Thank you! I was Kanata, the idol who cries her eyes out!

445
01:10:37,385 --> 01:10:40,985
6年間本当に幸せな日々でした！
These past six years truly have been such happy days!

446
01:10:41,485 --> 01:10:44,985
へ民、不器用な僕を応援してくれてありがとう！
Heimin, thank you for supporting clunky old me!

447
01:10:45,485 --> 01:10:48,985
ずっとずっと大好きだよ！ずっとずっと家族だよ！
I love you so, so much! We're family forever and ever!

448
01:10:49,485 --> 01:10:52,985
みんな本当にありがとうございました！
Thank you all so, so much!

449
01:10:57,985 --> 01:11:01,985
ありがとう！
Thank you!

